                                                "sense_id": "3dbb4c5f-1449-3c5c-9f69-2789095285f5",
                                                "text": "My first decision after being assured of victory was to choose my running mate. I decided that I needed to compensate for my lack of experience in Washington, and seriously considered Senators John Glenn, Frank Church, Scoop Jackson, Ed Muskie, and Walter Mondale."
                                            },
                                            {
